# LXP Bridge Project Overview

## Core Components

- **Main Application** ([src/main.rs](mdc:src/main.rs)): Entry point and application lifecycle
- **Configuration** ([src/config.rs](mdc:src/config.rs)): YAML-based configuration management
- **MQTT Client** ([src/mqtt.rs](mdc:src/mqtt.rs)): MQTT communication and message handling
- **Home Assistant Integration** ([src/home_assistant.rs](mdc:src/home_assistant.rs)): HA device discovery and state management
- **Inverter Communication** ([src/lxp/](mdc:src/lxp/)): Modbus TCP communication with Luxpower inverters
- **Command Processing** ([src/command.rs](mdc:src/command.rs)): Command routing and execution
- **Coordinator** ([src/coordinator/](mdc:src/coordinator/)): Central orchestration and data flow management
- **Scheduler** ([src/scheduler.rs](mdc:src/scheduler.rs)): Time-based task scheduling (e.g., time synchronization)

## Key Features

- Support for multiple inverters
- MQTT-based data publishing
- Home Assistant device discovery
- Modbus TCP communication
- Configurable time synchronization
- Reliable MQTT communication with retry logic and circuit breaker patterns
